theme_override_colors/default_color = Color(0, 0, 0, 1)
theme_override_fonts/normal_font = ExtResource("3_qjqth")
theme_override_font_sizes/normal_font_size = 24
text = "The state of the subject’s apartment was as follows.

The subject’s keys and handbag were left in the usual spot on the stand by the door, ready to leave. The door, however, was locked, meaning that when the subject left, she did not take her keys.

The mirror in the  bathroom and the mirror in the lobby both seem to have been smashed. 

Forensics team also recovered a hammer with fingerprints matching the victim. Our conclusion: A violent struggle in which the attacker overpowered the victim. "

